cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ThousandWorlds Explorer in your research or reporting, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ThousandWorlds Explorer"
authors:
  - family-names: "Shahjahan"
    given-names: "Hamza Ali"
version: 0.9.0
license: MIT
url: "https://thousandworldsexplorer.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hamza-ali-shahjahan/thousandworlds-explorer"
abstract: >-
  An explorable map of every world humanity has discovered — built on the NASA
  Exoplanet Archive — alongside the 1,659 simulated climates of the
  ThousandWorlds benchmark. Simulations and assumptions are always labeled;
  the app makes no habitability claims.
keywords:
  - exoplanets
  - astronomy
  - data-visualization
  - climate-emulation
  - NASA Exoplanet Archive
references:
